                    <chunk name="param_output" index="13">
                      <items count="6">
                        <item name="Description" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Fences, walls, retaining walls, hedges and city walls (OpenStreetMap barrier=*, ODbL) as ONE mesh of thin boxes, one per 2 m of line, standing on the ground under them at the height tagged or the kind's usual one. Needs Roads on. Over Terrain Size; the 20,000 boxes nearest the centre at most. For looking at and for a render, not a solver. The Report says what was found.</item>
                        <item name="InstanceGuid" type_name="gh_guid" type_code="9">5bf82ce4-2532-47a3-b639-b68508c3de72</item>
