                      <items count="6">
                        <item name="Description" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Benches, bus stops, hydrants and picnic tables (OpenStreetMap, ODbL) as ONE mesh of a few boxes each, standing on the ground. Needs Roads on. Axis-aligned (OpenStreetMap gives a node no heading); the 5,000 nearest the centre at most. For looking at and for a render, not a solver.</item>
