                      <items count="9">
                        <item name="Description" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">What the viewport shows: Smoke (dye streaming in from the inflow faces), Speed, Pressure (gauge, against the outflow), Vorticity, or LIC (speed under a line integral convolution of sparse noise: thin white strands gliding along the flow, a picture of the recent pathlines). With Mean on, Smoke, Speed, Pressure, Vorticity and the LIC's colours and strands show their time-mean; compare layouts that way, a single frame of a wake is gusty.</item>
