                    <chunk name="param_input" index="9">
                      <items count="6">
                        <item name="Description" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Optional ABL Flow, the component the wind studies and LBM Case take. Wired, it replaces Wind Speed and Wind Direction: the inflow is the log-law profile's speed at Cut Height, blowing in the ABL's first wind direction. The tunnel is 2D, so it carries that one speed; the profile's gradient up the buildings is not modelled.</item>
                        <item name="InstanceGuid" type_name="gh_guid" type_code="9">58f0f15b-d182-4041-abcb-5a61474b0776</item>
                        <item name="Name" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">ABL</item>
